				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "SN6505B U4 VCC close-to-pin bypass, 0.1uF (datasheet Sec 10 Power Supply Recommendations; Sec 9.2.2.4 puts the device bypass at 10-100 nF, so 100n is the top of the range -- do not grow the value with the package). 0805 rather than 0603: the wider 0.900 mm inter-pad channel clears PP_A/PP_B beneath the part, where 0603 gives only 0.650 mm against the 0.85 mm two HOST_SIDE traces need. Layout: place immediately at U4 pin 2, inboard of C7. C17 now covers the T1 centre-tap -- do not cluster C6 there."
			(at 0 0 270)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
